o?",{"id":313,"href":314,"linkText":315},"YhzT2BIAAC0A7Y9S","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fwhat-is-a-locker","What is a Locker?",{"id":317,"href":318,"linkText":319},"YhzSehIAACkA7Yjg","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fim-having-trouble-with-the-locker-what-can-i-do","I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",{"id":321,"href":322,"linkText":323},"YhzRghIAACkA7YTp","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fhow-do-i-use-a-locker","How do I use a Locker?",{"id":325,"href":326,"linkText":327},"YhzS9RIAAC0A7Ysk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fmy-barcode-isnt-scanning","My barcode isn't scanning","can-i-return-an-item-with-evri",{"titleTag":330,"metaDescription":331,"canonical":332,"subpath2":333,"category":342,"linkText":135,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":350},"Can I return an item with Evri? | FAQs | Evri","Wondering if you can return your online order with Evri? Find out how you can use our services to return parcels to some of the UK's biggest retailers.","can-i-return-an-item-with-evri.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Freturning-a-parcel\u002Fcan-i-return-an-item-with-evri",{"id":334,"type":335,"tags":336,"lang":337,"slug":101,"first_publication_date":338,"last_publication_date":338,"uid":101,"link_type":339,"key":340,"isBroken":341},"Yhj0bxIAACsA3CdK","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:23:31+0000","Document","e164b09d-e43f-45a4-802e-f6e3c42d4484",false,{"id":343,"type":344,"tags":345,"lang":337,"slug":101,"first_publication_date":347,"last_publication_date":348,"uid":101,"link_type":339,"key":349,"isBroken":341},"YitsOxEAACgAQyp0","faq-category",[346],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:35:54+0000","2022-05-12T12:56:20+0000","9e244789-7f57-462b-8ed1-908f7cb5812d",[351],{"variation":352,"version":353,"items":354,"primary":356,"id":423,"slice_type":424,"slice_label":425},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[355],{},{"content":357},[358,361,365,377,400,403],{"type":359,"text":135,"spans":360},"heading1",[],{"type":362,"text":363,"spans":364},"paragraph","Yes, provided that the retailer or seller uses Evri for their returns. ",[],{"type":362,"text":366,"spans":367},"First, check to see the way that the retailer or seller would like you to return your item. This could be a pre-printed label that came with your parcel, or your retailer might book it with us for you. ",[368,372],{"start":369,"end":370,"type":371},74,90,"strong",{"start":369,"end":370,"type":373,"data":374},"hyperlink",{"link_type":375,"url":376},"Web","can-i-return-an-item-with-evri.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Freturn-a-parcel",{"type":362,"text":378,"spans":379},"Or, you can use our app or website to return it yourself. Once you’ve booked your parcel collection or drop off, make sure the item you’re returning is packaged properly. ",[380,383,394,397],{"start":381,"end":382,"type":371},16,23,{"start":381,"end":382,"type":373,"data":384},{"id":385,"type":386,"tags":387,"lang":337,"slug":389,"first_publication_date":390,"last_publication_date":391,"uid":392,"url":393,"link_type":339,"isBroken":341},"YhZXZxIAACgA0Yuo","content-page",[388],"Our Services","download-the-evri-app","2022-02-23T16:01:29+0000","2026-04-28T12:20:10+0000","mobile-app","\u002Four-services\u002Fmobile-app",{"start":395,"end":396,"type":371},152,169,{"start":395,"end":396,"type":373,"data":398},{"link_type":375,"url":399},"can-i-return-an-item-with-evri.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",{"type":362,"text":401,"spans":402},"If you’ve booked a collection, your courier can collect your parcel between 8am and 8pm Monday to Friday, and between 8am to 6pm on Saturdays.",[],{"type":362,"text":404,"spans":405},"Or, if you’re dropping your parcel off at one of our ParcelShops, you’ll find that many of them are open early ‘til late, 7 days a week. Find your nearest ParcelShop.",[406,409,417,420],{"start":407,"end":408,"type":371},49,64,{"start":407,"end":408,"type":373,"data":410},{"id":411,"type":386,"tags":412,"lang":337,"slug":413,"first_publication_date":414,"last_publication_date